# Stone Hill deploy (customer #1)

www.shmspto.org deploys from **`auraflux-dev/shmspto`** only (treasurer Git), not this monorepo’s `origin`.

## Product vs customer

- Shared product → author in **`~/pavilion`**, ship demo, then **promote** when updating school.
- SHMS-only / hotfix → **`~/shmspto`**, then `ship-stone-hill.mjs`. Port hotfix back with `--from-shms` same day.

## Customer ship path

1. Promote if needed: `node scripts/promote-to-shms.mjs` (dry-run) / `--apply`  
2. Commit in **`shmspto`**  
3. `node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs`  
4. Confirm `check-prod-deploy.mjs`  

**Pushing `pavilion` main does not update www.**

## Agents cannot CLI-deploy Stone Hill from here

- No `vercel deploy` / treasurer link from this repo  
- CLI fallback only via `~/shmspto` ship script + Doppler treasurer token  

## Staging

Visitor review: https://shmspto.vercel.app when staging is current — Rob OK before production when visitor-facing.
